### Operator call scorecards (docs/api/scorecards.md). Configure criteria as a user with QUALITY_REVIEW_EDIT.

### Create a criterion
POST http://localhost:8080/api/scorecard-criteria
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Salomlashish",
  "instruction": "Operator suhbat boshida salomlashdimi va o'zini hamda kompaniyani tanishtirdimi",
  "weight": 2
}

### List criteria
POST http://localhost:8080/api/scorecard-criteria/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "page": 0, "size": 50, "enabled": true }

### Edit a criterion (full replace)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/scorecard-criteria/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Salomlashish",
  "instruction": "Operator suhbat boshida salomlashdimi va o'zini hamda kompaniyani tanishtirdimi",
  "weight": 3,
  "enabled": true
}

### A finished operator call's scorecard (404 until it has been scored)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calls/42/scorecard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The review inbox: scored operator calls waiting for a supervisor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-scorecards/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "page": 0, "size": 20, "status": "PENDING" }

### Review a scorecard: correct one answer (ids from answers[].id), or send no corrections to confirm
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-scorecards/42/review
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "corrections": [ { "answerId": 7, "answer": "YES" } ],
  "note": "Operator salomlashgan, transkriptda tushib qolgan"
}
